rustcfml-pii
Copyright 2026 RustCFML Team

This product includes ONNX exports of the ettin-*-nemotron-pii models,
copyright Kalyan KS, MIT licensed (https://huggingface.co/kalyan-ks), which
are built on the Ettin encoders (Johns Hopkins University CLSP, MIT) and
fine-tuned on the Nemotron-PII dataset (NVIDIA, CC BY 4.0). Full attribution
is in models/README.md. The exports are not inside a built `.rcx`; the
extension fetches them from this repository at run time.

This product is built against RustCFML (https://github.com/RustCFML/RustCFML),
copyright the RustCFML Team, MIT licensed.

A compiled `.rcx` statically links this project's Rust dependencies and their
transitive dependencies. Full third-party license texts and per-crate copyright
notices are in THIRD-PARTY.txt, which is packaged inside the `.rcx` alongside
this file.
